      "text": "Role in ADHD:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " atomoxetine = effective, but data are mixed vs stimulants; once-a-day dosing (long ½ life), but it must be taken continuously to work."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
