      "text": "Strattera label:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " ADHD in adults and pts ≥ 6 y; boxed warning: ↑suicidal ideation in pts ≥ 6 y w ADHD (short-term studies); monitor closely, esp in the first mo and @ dose chgs."
